1
00:00:00,112 --> 00:00:02,532
(Ramona:)Again, ew.

2
00:00:04,366 --> 00:00:07,576
(Ramona:)You know, I'd love to hear more
about how you intend to add neutrinos.

3
00:00:07,744 --> 00:00:11,294
(Ramona:)- Could we get a cup of coffee sometime?
- I don't drink coffee.

4
00:00:11,456 --> 00:00:13,416
(Howard:)I do. I love me a cup of Joe.

5
00:00:14,084 --> 00:00:16,214
(Ramona:)It doesn't have to be coffee.
How about dinner?

6
00:00:16,378 --> 00:00:19,468
- I do eat dinner.
- Great. I know a terrific little Italian place.

7
00:00:19,631 --> 00:00:23,721
(Sheldon:)I never eat in strange restaurants.
One runs the risk of non-standard cutlery.

8
00:00:25,053 --> 00:00:29,763
- Excuse me?
- Sheldon lives in fear of the three-tined fork.

9
00:00:29,933 --> 00:00:33,103
(Sheldon:)Three tines is not a fork.
Three tines is a trident.

10
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:37,440
(Sheldon:)Forks are for eating,
tridents are for ruling the seven seas.

11
00:00:38,734 --> 00:00:42,234
- What if I brought food to your place?
- That would be acceptable.

12
00:00:42,404 --> 00:00:43,864
(Sheldon:)On Mondays, I eat Thai food.

13
00:00:44,031 --> 00:00:47,661
Mee Krob and chicken satay
with extra peanut sauce from Siam Palace.

14
00:00:47,826 --> 00:00:50,826
(Ramona:)You got it. I already have your address.

15
00:00:54,166 --> 00:00:56,246
(Sheldon:)What a nice girl.

